# Exploration Sites

> Exploration Sites is an investor-relations visualization studio for exploration and mining companies, based in Victoria, British Columbia, Canada, working since 1996. It makes investor maps (locator, property, geoscience, drill plans and sections, 3D), corporate investor presentations, fact sheets, investor websites, brand identities, and 3D GIS films, so that generalist investors can understand a mineral project. It has served 300+ exploration teams on five continents. All prices are in Canadian dollars, before tax.

Exploration Sites is a communications and design studio: it does not give investment advice, is not a securities dealer, and does not prepare NI 43-101 technical reports. Company figures shown in its work are as reported by each issuer.

